===Adjective===
{{en-adj|er,more}}

# Moving with [[speed]], [[rapidity]] or [[swiftness]], or capable of doing so; [[rapid]]; [[fast]].
#: {{ux|en|I ran to the station – but I wasn't '''quick''' enough.}}
#: {{ux|en|He's a '''quick''' runner.}}
